                   │
                   ▼
            SENSING / OBSERVATION
                   │
                   ▼
     PROVENANCE + EVIDENCE GRAPH
                   │
                   ▼
ONTOLOGY + WORLD MODEL + CAUSAL MODEL
                   │
                   ▼
  UNCERTAINTY / CONTRADICTION / NOVELTY
                   │
                   ▼
      GOAL & QUESTION GENERATION
                   │
                   ▼
               HYPOTHESIS
                   │
                   ▼
       PREDICTION / COUNTERFACTUALS
                   │
                   ▼
           EXPERIMENT DESIGN
                   │
                   ▼
       SANDBOX / REALITY INTERACTION
                   │
                   ▼
               EXPERIENCE
                   │
                   ▼
